  {
    "case_id": "steam:232777804:2",
    "category": "numeric_example_leak",
    "source": {
      "record_id": "steam:232777804",
      "platform": "steam",
      "source_id": "232777804",
      "text_original": "The Good \n-Casual Friendly with easy controls for people to pick up and play\n-Tons of players\n-A decent roster size at this point\n-Easy to swap characters if your in a rough drought \n-Game runs well and has the best netcode\n-Animations look great\n\nThe Bad\n-Modern controls hurts the balance and design of the game which leaves characters in awkward states \n-Game does no changes because they are scared to do antyhing\n-Raw drive rush, drive rush fireball, throw loops,  Brainless offense needs to be removed/toned down \n-Defensive mechanics do not exist - all the defense mechanics are directly used for generating offense - drive reversal is unreliable and if your playing a character with no dp or reversal level 1.....  your going to hate your life.\n-People can rage quit at the end of a match in masters to avoid giving you points even though the games over\n-People will turn on the lag switch randomly with no bans\n-People are actually caught for cheats and all they get is a rank reset\n-Nobody plays footsies in this game because of all the neutral skip garbage slop\n-Character balance on the surface level seems very good until you realize its trash\n-Balance changes like doubling down on throw loops, ryu apparently having issues generating offense and somehow zangief players being confused at when russian suplex will come out .....? who wrote these patch notes - clearly someone with 0 iq.\n-S4 pass is TERRIBLE outside tifa\n-Yasmine is by far the worst character i've ever seen in a fighting game period.\n\nYou can blame the balance team, you can blame the planning team - but really if you ask players how they feel about the game state that play ranked..... they will tell you its stale and boring and this is NAKAYAMAS fault, terrible director and should be fired immediately - i do not sympathize with developers that ask for 80 dollar base game -> 40 CAD season passes. Charging this much, you better deliver  or prepare to be critiqued.",
      "language": "en",
      "retrieved_at_utc": "2026-10-15T07:14:32.757772+00:00",
      "target_patch_context": "2026-08-03 (context only; applicability not verified)",
      "patch_relevance": "unreviewed",
